# Podman/Docker build exclusions.
#
# This file is NOT optional and .gitignore does NOT substitute for it: podman
# ignores .gitignore entirely, so `COPY . .` in the Containerfile was pulling
# target/ (2.1 GB) and the live data/phisix.db into the build context. That is
# what made the builder layer 3.82 GB against a 98.5 MB final image.
target/
data/
.git/
notebooks/
bruno/
